---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact · Accanto"
  description="Write to us for questions, suggestions or feedback. We reply personally."
>
  <section class="container-page container-prose">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Contact</p>
    <h1>Write to us</h1>
    <p>We are a small team and we actually read every email. If you have a question, a suggestion or want to tell us about your experience, we're glad to hear from you.</p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:info@accanto.care">info@accanto.care</a><br />
      For privacy or data requests: <a href="mailto:privacy@accanto.care">privacy@accanto.care</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Self-hosting</h2>
    <p>Want to install Accanto on your own server or inside an organization? Reach out and we will help with the basic configuration.</p>

    <h2>Response time</h2>
    <p>We try to reply within a few business days. Please avoid sending sensitive health information via email.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
